# .graphifyignore — gitignore syntax; .gitignore is already respected and
# merged in, so this file only ever *excludes more*. Rebuild after editing:
#   graphify . --update
#
# Sizes below are what the 2026-09-07 graph actually ingested (346 files,
# per graphify-out/manifest.json), not guesses.

# ── Vendored / generated: no project signal, huge volume ──────────────
# All gitignored already; repeated here because `--update --no-gitignore`
# would otherwise pull ~10k vendor files into the graph.
/vendor/
/var/
/public/assets/
/assets/vendor/
/graphify-out/
/.phpunit.cache/

# 104 KB of auto-generated array shapes for App::config(). Nothing loads it;
# it is an IDE assist. Largest single file the last build ingested.
/config/reference.php

# ── Portable agent skills: generic Symfony/PHP guidance, not this app ──
# 142 files (41% of the last build) documenting API Platform, Messenger,
# Pest… none of which Mikono uses. They drown the real domain nodes.
/.agents/skills/
/.claude/skills/
/.codex/skills/
/.gemini/skills/

# ── Editor / machine-local state ──────────────────────────────────────
/.vscode/
/.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Symlink duplicates of AGENTS.md ───────────────────────────────────
# CLAUDE.md and GEMINI.md are symlinks to AGENTS.md; indexing all three
# triples the same 29 KB and creates three nodes for one document.
# AGENTS.md itself stays — it is the richest description of the project.
/CLAUDE.md
/GEMINI.md

# ── Brand assets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ~51 KB each of raw SVG path data. Zero extractable meaning.
/public/brand/

# ── docs/: keep the decisions, drop the archaeology ───────────────────
# docs/adr/ stays. It is the "why" behind the code and is the single most
# valuable thing in the repo for a knowledge graph — do not exclude it.
/docs/adr/template.md

# Brainstorms are pre-decision narrative, superseded by the ADRs they led
# to. AGENTS.md itself says "Don't read that folder at session start: most
# of it describes decisions already shipped and locked into ADRs." In a
# graph, rejected alternatives read as current fact.
# Flip this if you ever want to query "why did we *not* do X".
/docs/brainstorm/

# 97 KB dated changelog — the largest doc in the repo and entirely past
# tense. Its durable conclusions are already in ADRs or AGENTS.md.
# next-steps.md, deployment-plan.md and hosting-plan.md stay: current.
/docs/project/done.md

# Roster data, not structure: 15 volunteer names, 13 sites, 102 activity
# rows. Adds ~30 person/place nodes that look like architecture but aren't.
# docs/fixtures/README.md stays — it holds the transcription rules.
/docs/fixtures/rosters.yaml

# ── Generated schema DDL ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# make:migration output — ALTER TABLE strings that restate src/Entity/,
# which is the source of truth and stays indexed.
/migrations/

# ── Lockfiles / tool baselines ────────────────────────────────────────
# 436 KB of resolved dependency hashes; composer.json stays.
/composer.lock
/phpstan-baseline.neon
/.php-cs-fixer.cache
/LICENSE
